SUMMARY:Mirabel Wigon: Earth Stars
DESCRIPTION:Mirabel Wigon: Earth Stars\nExhibit: July 10 – August 16\, 2026\nReception: July 10\, 6-9 PM (Free) \nMirabel Wigon’s Earth Stars features imagined and fantastical futures with flora as the main subject. Her paintings deconstruct and reconstruct plant forms to explore the intermingled and entangled relationships in the natural world. Her range of mediated source materials\, including photogrammetry scans of botanical specimens\, offers new ways of looking at our planetary cohabitants. Wigon uses augmented reality to reveal the 3D models made through photogrammetry\, further entangling the viewer in the processes of the paintings’ construction. Her reflections of mediation and translation call for a future that values diversity\, adaptation\, and perseverance. \nImage: Mirabel Wigon\, “Celestial Lattice”
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/mirabel-wigon-earth-stars/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Mirabel-Wigon-Celestial-Lattice.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
